<view class="page preferences-page">
  <view class="preferences-hero"><text class="preferences-kicker">M-BOX · YOUR NIGHT</text><text class="preferences-title">我的偏好</text><text class="preferences-copy">只为本店的推荐与服务安排使用；生日仅保存月日，用于已发布的生日权益。</text></view>
  <state-panel wx:if="{{loading}}" type="loading" title="正在读取偏好" />
  <block wx:else>
    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-banner">{{error}}</view>
    <view class="preference-card identity-card"><text class="field-label">怎么称呼您</text><input value="{{displayName}}" maxlength="80" placeholder="例如：张小姐" bindinput="onNameInput" /></view>
    <view class="preference-card"><view class="card-head"><text>到店时更想坐哪里？</text><text>可随时修改</text></view><view class="chip-grid"><button wx:for="{{seats}}" wx:key="value" class="option-chip {{seatIndex === index ? 'is-selected' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="chooseSeat">{{item.label}}</button></view></view>
    <view class="preference-card"><view class="card-head"><text>希望我们怎样照顾这晚？</text><text>可随时修改</text></view><view class="chip-grid"><button wx:for="{{service}}" wx:key="value" class="option-chip {{serviceIndex === index ? 'is-selected' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="chooseService">{{item.label}}</button></view></view>
    <view class="preference-card"><view class="card-head"><text>通常会想喝什么？</text><text>用于推荐</text></view><view class="chip-grid"><button wx:for="{{alcohol}}" wx:key="value" class="option-chip {{alcoholIndex === index ? 'is-selected' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="chooseAlcohol">{{item.label}}</button></view></view>
    <view class="preference-card"><text class="field-label">生日</text><picker mode="selector" range="{{birthdays}}" range-key="label" value="{{birthdayIndex}}" bindchange="onBirthdayChange"><view class="picker-line"><text>{{birthdays[birthdayIndex].label}}</text><text>›</text></view></picker><text class="field-note">我们只保存月日，不保存出生年份。</text></view>
    <view class="preference-card compact-fields"><label><text>口味偏好</text><input value="{{tasteNotes}}" maxlength="80" placeholder="如：清爽、少甜" bindinput="onTasteInput" /></label><label><text>音乐偏好</text><input value="{{musicStyles}}" maxlength="80" placeholder="如：流行、爵士、摇滚" bindinput="onMusicInput" /></label><label><text>饮食说明</text><input value="{{dietaryNotes}}" maxlength="80" placeholder="只填写与点单推荐有关的信息" bindinput="onDietaryInput" /></label></view>
    <button class="save-button" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存偏好</button>
    <text class="privacy-note">头像上传不在此页开放：目前没有可审计的头像存储与删除能力，不会把临时微信图片假装保存为个人头像。</text>
  </block>
</view>
